  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "dgs-pose",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDatenset zur Implementierung von Einzelgeb\u00e4rdenerkennung f\u00fcr Geb\u00e4rden der Deutschen Geb\u00e4rdensprache\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nThis dataset consists of short video clips and pose estimation outputs capturing individual signs from German Sign Language (Deutsche Geb\u00e4rdensprache, DGS). It is designed for training and evaluating models on isolated sign recognition tasks. The dataset includes both raw video data and .pev files, which adhere to the\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/fhswf/dgs-pose.",
